; Logical Rounding Cast : the EXPLICIT rounding integer -> float
; conversion, to the nearest representable value with ties to even (C++'s
; `static_cast<float>(n)`, PyTorch's count divisors). Total. The TARGET
; dtype rides in the term; the bit width changes, so this is always a
; materializer, never a view. Plain LogicalCast stays lossless-only.
(constructor LogicalRoundingCast (LogicalTensor Dtype) LogicalTensor)
